or month and go back.

00:53:06.300 --> 00:53:09.000
I'm not talking about
scholars at risk staying here,

00:53:09.000 --> 00:53:10.660
I'm talking about people who come,

00:53:10.660 --> 00:53:12.800
take a breather, and return.

00:53:12.800 --> 00:53:16.845
I'm talking about exchange of
faculty, exchange of students.

00:53:16.845 --> 00:53:19.500
Thinking about research
that we can do together.

00:53:19.500 --> 00:53:21.010
There's a lot that we can learn

00:53:21.010 --> 00:53:23.340
from our partners in the global north

00:53:23.340 --> 00:53:26.330
but there's a lot that our
partners in the global north

00:53:26.330 --> 00:53:27.950
