00:53:27.950 --> 00:53:29.570
How do we deal with these problems?

00:53:29.570 --> 00:53:31.960
They're not in any textbook frankly,

00:53:31.960 --> 00:53:33.040
they're not in any textbook,

00:53:33.040 --> 00:53:35.120
this is not what we teach our students.

00:53:35.120 --> 00:53:39.280
The textbook is being written
