00:54:28.908 --> 00:54:31.020
I wanted to say thank you doctor Nuwayhid

00:54:31.020 --> 00:54:32.550
for a phenomenal presentation

00:54:32.550 --> 00:54:36.483
that really sums up
decades of inefficiency,

00:54:37.660 --> 00:54:40.990
a lot of problems in the region

00:54:40.990 --> 00:54:43.590
that kind of mostly get summarized

00:54:43.590 --> 00:54:46.520
by in Lebanon specifically

00:54:46.520 --> 00:54:48.340
a country where people did not

00:54:49.310 --> 00:54:51.090
have to face any dictatorship

00:54:51.090 --> 00:54:54.980
really had the chance to go and vote.

00:54:54.980 --> 00:54:58.060
And they voted for the
same people left or right

00:54:58.060 --> 00:55:00.710
who kind of had opposing political views,

00:55:00.710 --> 00:55:02.470
but for 40 years did not provide

00:55:02.470 --> 00:55:04.160
any sense of accountability.

00:55:04.160 --> 00:55:06.800
A system that was based on clientelism

00:55:06.800 --> 00:55:09.060
where people who wanted to go and get

00:55:10.926 --> 00:55:12.820
a surgery but they could not afford

00:55:12.820 --> 00:55:14.810
they would go to the politician

00:55:14.810 --> 00:55:18.470
who would go and pay for that procedure.

00:55:18.470 --> 00:55:21.040
If they wanted access to clean water

00:55:21.040 --> 00:55:24.790
or a healthy and a good
environment to live in,

00:55:24.790 --> 00:55:26.470
the clientelism of the politicians

00:55:26.470 --> 00:55:27.940
was the thing that they should.

00:55:27.940 --> 00:55:29.757
And you would only see that
every four to six years

00:55:29.757 --> 00:55:32.190
whenever elections would happen.

00:55:32.190 --> 00:55:33.857
The other comment I wanted to talk about

00:55:33.857 --> 00:55:37.290
