00:55:43.560 --> 00:55:45.690
but we do not have a focus or emphasis

00:55:45.690 --> 00:55:48.548
on healthcare management and
healthcare administration

00:55:48.548 --> 00:55:51.270
which does not I think in my opinion

00:55:51.270 --> 00:55:53.670
equip the young Lebanese generation

00:55:53.670 --> 00:55:58.150
with the principles to create
sustainable innovations.

00:55:58.150 --> 00:56:00.570
Because all what I see is a lot of times

00:56:00.570 --> 00:56:02.790
organizations and GO's come into Lebanon,

00:56:02.790 --> 00:56:06.940
they do a project, they
patch a certain situation,

00:56:06.940 --> 00:56:09.090
but who are not having a reform

00:56:09.090 --> 00:56:11.820
and a system that is already
broken on so many levels.

00:56:11.820 --> 00:56:16.400
So I feel like if we need to make change

00:56:16.400 --> 00:56:18.210
it has to be a big reform

00:56:18.210 --> 00:56:21.370
rather just patching or covering holes

00:56:22.280 --> 00:56:23.810
in the meantime.

00:56:23.810 --> 00:56:25.116
